Tofu Reader

Tofu Reader is a personal fork of CrossPoint Reader, maintained by Ekky Pramana for
one Xteink X4 Pro unit. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the
CrossPoint Reader organization, its contributors, or Xteink.

  Upstream project:   https://github.com/crosspoint-reader/crosspoint-reader
  Base of this fork:  upstream tag 2.0.0rc (commit 91ed3ef)

Licensing. The upstream firmware and the FreeInk SDK are MIT licensed. The original
MIT copyright notice in LICENSE is preserved unchanged and covers all upstream code
in this repository. Copyright (c) 2026 Ekky Pramana covers the changes made in this
fork; those changes are released under the same MIT terms.

This repository ships no vendor firmware images, no bootloader dumps and no
proprietary blobs from the device manufacturer.
